Recorded with Claude Code 2.1.226 (`claude --print --output-format stream-json --verbose --json-schema ...`).
The line shapes (system init, assistant message envelopes, user tool_result, result) are recorded; the system line is
reduced to the fields the parser reads, the tool_use/tool_result turns and the successful result (structured_output,
usage, total_cost_usd) were synthesized because the CLI's OAuth session had expired at recording time. `claude-json.json`
is the same result object as produced by `--output-format json` (the fallback path). Re-record with an authenticated CLI
when available; the parsers treat unknown lines as raw, so a re-recording must not break them.
